        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1096">

                <pb facs="1129" n="1009" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg1009"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Bowen to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Caracas,
                                Venezuela</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-05-14"><hi rendition="#italic">May 14,
                        1904.</hi></date></dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 286.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose herewith a
                    translation of a note I received from the minister for foreign affairs in regard
                    to the memorandum I left with him about paying the creditor nations 5,400,000
                    bolivars annually, and my answer thereto. If I receive any other communication
                    from him on the subject, I will send to you forthwith a translation thereof.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Herbert W. Bowen.</hi></signed></closer>




                <xi:include href="d1096-a1.xml" xpointer="d1096-a1"/>
